/T (In February, the Australian healthcare sector faced a devastating blow when Genea, a major fertility clinic network, was targeted by the ransomware group Termite. The attackers claimed to have exfiltrated nearly 940 GB of highly sensitive medical data, including reproductive health records, patient identities, and internal communications. )
/E (In February, the Australian healthcare sector faced a devastating blow when Genea, a major fertility clinic network, was targeted by the ransomware group Termite. The attackers claimed to have exfiltrated nearly 940 GB of highly sensitive medical data, including reproductive health records, patient identities, and internal communications. )
