<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Meanwhile, WOLF CYBER ARMY \(128\) and Market Exchange \(122\) have gained prominence for orchestrating large-scale credential dumps and malware-as-a-service offerings. Threat actors like Akira \(82\), previously linked to ransomware campaigns against mid-size enterprises, and Mysterious Team Bangladesh \(77\), known for ideological attacks and web defacements, continue to pose regional and sector-specific risks.)
/E (Meanwhile, WOLF CYBER ARMY \(128\) and Market Exchange \(122\) have gained prominence for orchestrating large-scale credential dumps and malware-as-a-service offerings. Threat actors like Akira \(82\), previously linked to ransomware campaigns against mid-size enterprises, and Mysterious Team Bangladesh \(77\), known for ideological attacks and web defacements, continue to pose regional and sector-specific risks.)
